message: "If you use Astrocook in your research, please cite the paper below. To cite the software itself, use the DOI of the software."
title: "Astrocook"
abstract: "Astrocook is a Python package for the analysis of quasar spectra: continuum fitting, identification of absorption systems and Voigt fitting, with a PySide6 graphical interface and a scriptable API."
